          "text": "🇺🇸 Trump follows up: \"Also, with respect to the Iran negotiations, Iran should be responsible for the damages and death caused to the people of Lebanon, Syria, Yemen, and Gaza.\" Source: @realDonaldTrump / Writer: Oliver Mario Nawfal (@MarioNawfal) 🇺🇸 🇮🇷 Iran wants compensation for the 5-month war. Trump's response: sure, let's do the math both ways. Trump said he's now \"likewise demanding compensation from Iran,\" citing the roadside bombs and \"many conflicts\" tied to the late General Qassem Soleimani, families of those killed on the USS Cole, \"hundreds of thousands\" of protesters Iran has alle",
