        {
          "handle": "MarioNawfal",
          "creator": "@MarioNawfal",
          "text": "🇨🇴 The city of Pereira is a mess after the quake in Colombia. The coffee-region saw building facades shear off, the Matecaña airport lose chunks of roof, and the San José church spire come crashing down. Streets filled with rubble while people ran for cover. Writer: Lucas Video",
