          "text": "🚴I was certain that he wouldn’t make it! This is what you call a UNIQUE talent! Video Raghu (@IndiaTales7) A cyclist who understands physics better than most engineers. Video — https://nitter.net/IndiaTales7/status/2085403062013919735#m",
