          "handle": "MarioNawfal",
          "creator": "@MarioNawfal",
          "text": "🇪🇸 Thousands of Ceuta residents just took to the streets. They’re fed up with the uncontrolled mass arrival of illegal migrants and are demanding real protection from Spain and Europe. Frankly, they have every right to demand action. Writer: Daniyal Video",
          "link": "https://nitter.net/MarioNawfal/status/2086865157527941364#m",
