        {
          "handle": "MarioNawfal",
          "creator": "@MarioNawfal",
          "text": "🇺🇸🇨🇴 Rubio locked in full U.S. support for Colombia after the deadly 7.4 quake. The tremor hit hard, flattening buildings in parts of Cali and shaking the whole country. Rubio said the Trump team is watching closely and ready to help the people plus their brand-new president, Abelardo De La Espriella, who only took office three days ago. Colombia just flipped hard toward America, and right now needs all the support it can get. Writer: Lucas Video",
