          "creator": "@MarioNawfal",
          "text": "🇮🇷🇺🇸 Iran has hit U.S. military assets with 2,000+ missile and drone strikes since Operation Epic Fury began, causing ~$13 BILLION in damage across 20 facilities in 8 countries, and destroying or damaging 42 U.S. aircraft. Source: WSJ / Writer: Oliver",
