        {
          "handle": "MarioNawfal",
          "creator": "@MarioNawfal",
          "text": "🇹🇼 Taiwan has never been independent, says the Kuomintang Chairwoman. Cheng Li-wun called the ruling Democratic Progressive Party’s claim (DPP) that Taiwan is already its own country pure nonsense. The Kuomintang is the old Chinese Nationalist Party that ruled all of China before the Communists took over in 1949 and then retreated to the island. They still see the Republic of China as the legitimate government of the whole country, so in their view Taiwan is not a separate independent nation. That’s why they reject formal independence. Writer: Lucas Video",
          "link": "https://nitter.net/MarioNawfal/status/2086855091194405301#m",
