          "creator": "@MarioNawfal",
          "text": "🇺🇸 🇮🇷 Iran wants compensation for the 5-month war. Trump's response: sure, let's do the math both ways. Trump said he's now \"likewise demanding compensation from Iran,\" citing the roadside bombs and \"many conflicts\" tied to the late General Qassem Soleimani, families of those killed on the USS Cole, \"hundreds of thousands\" of protesters Iran has allegedly killed over 50 years, and 52,000 killed in the last 5 months of fighting. He says he's instructed his team to put it \"firmly\" into all future negotiations. Bottom line: nobody's paying anybody anytime soon. Source: @realDonaldTrump / Writer: ",
